    "body": "## Summary\n\n- Synced the existing branch with current `main@31b7a077820914e92de81239e5ab4099e3dfa558` using a non-force merge commit; resolved the real `ui-core.js` conflict in both mirrors.\n- Kept the current app's existing `mobilePanelTabs` / `ui-mobile.js` navigation as the single source for tab switching, gestures, long-press hints, accessibility, and panel scroll state. Removed the duplicate tab/gesture path from the stale PR implementation.\n- Added visualViewport keyboard state, compact controls, and a minimum-height calculation for the chat and panel regions.\n- Prevented the open mobile Goal body from flex-shrinking to zero.\n- Updated the regression runner to exercise the current app markup and navigation.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly these five paths differ from current main:\n\n- `AsyncScene/Web/ui/ui-core.js`\n- `docs/ui/ui-core.js`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/style-base.css`\n- `docs/style-base.css`\n- `tools/test_mobile_shell_regressions.html`\n\nPR #453 remains untouched. No Chat03, Chat04.1 implementation, Stage 7.15, Cloudflare, or game mechanics changes are included.\n\n## Verification on exact HEAD `8b802f37f3e4b1da3512cc1e26ac4d98e9019496`\n\n- `python3 tools/test_mobile_first_interface_contract.py`: 14/14 PASS.\n- `node --check` for both UI-core mirrors and the regression runner script: PASS.\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\n- Web/docs `ui-core.js` and `style-base.css`: byte-identical.\n- GitHub Actions [ai-forensics-evidence run 40867459087](https://github.com/samuray-games/AsyncScene/actions/runs/40867459087): SUCCESS. This workflow does not execute the mobile regression runner.\n- The requested visual Codex Browser run could not be performed: the in-app browser rejected local-file navigation under its URL policy, and the sandbox denied binding a local HTTP port. No browser visual PASS is claimed.\n- Real OS keyboard and physical iPhone/Safari acceptance remain untested and user-owned.\n\nKeep this PR Draft. Request independent review and browser/Safari acceptance before merge.",
